      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"9\" type=\"會\">9 大乘十法會</cb:mulu>\r\n<milestone n=\"29\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c04\">0158c04</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c05\">0158c05</span><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c06\">0158c06</span><cb:juan n=\"029\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"029\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第二十九</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c07\">0158c07</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c08\">0158c08</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158001\">〔大〕－【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158001\">大【大】＊，〔－〕【明】＊</span><app n=\"0158001\"><p class=\"lg\">大</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>唐<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158002\">三藏＋（法師）【明】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158002\">三藏【大】＊，三藏法師【明】＊</span><app n=\"0158002\"><p class=\"lg\">三藏</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">三藏法師</rdg></app>菩提流志奉　<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158003\">詔＝誥【宋】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158003\">詔【大】＊，誥【宋】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0158003\"><p class=\"lg\">詔</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】\">誥</rdg></app>譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c09\">0158c09</span><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"10\" type=\"會\">10 文殊師利普門會</cb:mulu><head>文殊師利普門會第十</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c10\">0158c10</span><p>如是我聞：</p><p>一時佛在王舍城耆闍崛山中，與\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c11\">0158c11</span>大比丘眾八百人俱，菩薩摩訶薩四萬二千。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c12\">0158c12</span>時有菩薩名無垢藏，與九萬二千諸菩薩眾，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c13\">0158c13</span>恭敬圍遶從空而來。爾時世尊即告大眾：「彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c14\">0158c14</span>諸菩薩，為遍清淨行世界普花如來勸發，來\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c15\">0158c15</span>此娑婆世界，令於我所聽受普入不思議法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c16\">0158c16</span>門；其諸菩薩亦當集會。」說是語已，無量無邊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c17\">0158c17</span>他方此界諸菩薩眾，悉來集會耆闍崛山，頂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c18\">0158c18</span>禮佛足却住一面。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c19\">0158c19</span><p>爾時無垢藏菩薩手持七寶千葉蓮花，至如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c20\">0158c20</span>來所頭面禮足，白佛言：「世尊！遍清淨行世界\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c21\">0158c21</span>普花如來，以是寶花奉上世尊。致問無量，少\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c22\">0158c22</span>病少惱、起居輕利、安樂行不？」作是語已，即昇\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c23\">0158c23</span>虛空結<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158004\">加＝跏【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0158004\">加【大】，跏【明】</span><app n=\"0158004\"><p class=\"lg\">加</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">跏</rdg></app>趺坐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c24\">0158c24</span><p>爾時文殊師利菩薩摩訶薩，於大眾中即從\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c25\">0158c25</span>座起，偏袒右肩右膝著地，合掌恭敬而白佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c26\">0158c26</span>言：「我念過去久遠世時，曾於普燈佛所聞說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c27\">0158c27</span>普入不思議法門。我於爾時即便獲得八千\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c28\">0158c28</span>四百億那由他三昧，又能了知七十七萬億\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0158c29\">0158c29</span>那由他三昧。善哉世尊！願垂哀愍為諸菩薩\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a01\">0159a01</span>說此法門。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a02\">0159a02</span><p>爾時佛告文殊師利：「汝今諦聽，善思念之，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a03\">0159a03</span>為汝說。」</p><p>文殊師利言：「唯然世尊！願樂欲聞。」</p><p>佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a04\">0159a04</span>言：「若諸菩薩欲學此法，應當修習諸三昧門。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a05\">0159a05</span>所謂色相三昧、聲相三昧、香相三昧、味相三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a06\">0159a06</span>昧、觸相三昧、意界三昧、女相三昧、男相三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a07\">0159a07</span>昧、童男相三昧、童女相三昧、天相三昧、龍相\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a08\">0159a08</span>三昧、夜叉相三昧、乾闥婆相三昧、阿修羅相\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a09\">0159a09</span>三昧、迦樓羅相三昧、緊那羅相三昧、摩睺羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a10\">0159a10</span>伽相三昧、地獄相三昧、畜生相三昧、閻魔羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a11\">0159a11</span>界三昧、貪相三昧、瞋相三昧、癡相三昧、不善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a12\">0159a12</span>法三昧、善法三昧、有為三昧、無為三昧。文殊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a13\">0159a13</span>師利！若諸菩薩於如是等一切三昧善通達\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a14\">0159a14</span>者，是則已為修學此法。文殊師利！云何名為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a15\">0159a15</span>色相三昧？即說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a16\">0159a16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「觀色如聚沫，<caesura/>中無有堅實，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a17\">0159a17</span><p class=\"lg\">不可執持故，<caesura/>是名色三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a18\">0159a18</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為聲相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a19\">0159a19</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a20\">0159a20</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「觀聲如谷響，<caesura/>其性不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a21\">0159a21</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法亦如是，<caesura/>無相無差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a22\">0159a22</span><p class=\"lg\">了知皆寂靜，<caesura/>是名聲三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a23\">0159a23</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為香相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a24\">0159a24</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a25\">0159a25</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「假令百千劫，<caesura/>常嗅種種香，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a26\">0159a26</span><p class=\"lg\">如海納眾流，<caesura/>而無有厭足。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a27\">0159a27</span><p class=\"lg\">其香若是實，<caesura/>則應可滿足，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a28\">0159a28</span><p class=\"lg\">但有假名字，<caesura/>其實不可取。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159a29\">0159a29</span><p class=\"lg\">以不可取故，<caesura/>鼻亦無所有，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b01\">0159b01</span><p class=\"lg\">了知性空寂，<caesura/>是名香三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b02\">0159b02</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為味相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b03\">0159b03</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b04\">0159b04</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「舌根之所受，<caesura/>鹹醋等諸<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0159b0401\">味【CB】【麗-CB】，昧【大】</span><app n=\"0159b0401\"><p class=\"lg\">味<note type=\"cf1\">K06n0022_p0223b16</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">昧</rdg></app>，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b05\">0159b05</span><p class=\"lg\">皆從眾緣生，<caesura/>其性無所有。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b06\">0159b06</span><p class=\"lg\">若能如是知，<caesura/>因緣和合起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b07\">0159b07</span><p class=\"lg\">了此不思議，<caesura/>是名味三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b08\">0159b08</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為觸相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b09\">0159b09</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b10\">0159b10</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「觸但有名字，<caesura/>其性不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b11\">0159b11</span><p class=\"lg\">細滑等諸法，<caesura/>皆是從緣生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b12\">0159b12</span><p class=\"lg\">若能知觸性，<caesura/>因緣和合起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b13\">0159b13</span><p class=\"lg\">畢竟無所有，<caesura/>是名觸三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b14\">0159b14</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為意<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0159001\">界＋（相）【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0159001\">界【大】，界相【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0159001\"><p class=\"lg\">界</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">界相</rdg></app>三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b15\">0159b15</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b16\">0159b16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「設集三千界，<caesura/>無量諸眾生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b17\">0159b17</span><p class=\"lg\">一心共思求，<caesura/>意界不可得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b18\">0159b18</span><p class=\"lg\">不在於內外，<caesura/>亦不可聚集，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b19\">0159b19</span><p class=\"lg\">但以於假名，<caesura/>說有種種相。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b20\">0159b20</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如於幻化，<caesura/>無住無處所，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b21\">0159b21</span><p class=\"lg\">了知彼性空，<caesura/>是名意三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b22\">0159b22</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為女相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b23\">0159b23</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b24\">0159b24</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「四大假為女，<caesura/>其中無所有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b25\">0159b25</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫迷惑心，<caesura/>執取以為實。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b26\">0159b26</span><p class=\"lg\">女人如幻化，<caesura/>愚者不能了，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b27\">0159b27</span><p class=\"lg\">妄見女相故，<caesura/>生於染著心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b28\">0159b28</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如幻化女，<caesura/>而非實女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159b29\">0159b29</span><p class=\"lg\">無智者迷惑，<caesura/>便生於欲想。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c01\">0159c01</span><p class=\"lg\">如是了知已，<caesura/>一切女無相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c02\">0159c02</span><p class=\"lg\">此相皆寂靜，<caesura/>是名女三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c03\">0159c03</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為男相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c04\">0159c04</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c05\">0159c05</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「自謂是男子，<caesura/>見彼為女人，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c06\">0159c06</span><p class=\"lg\">由斯分別心，<caesura/>而生於欲想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c07\">0159c07</span><p class=\"lg\">欲心本無有，<caesura/>心相不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c08\">0159c08</span><p class=\"lg\">由妄分別故，<caesura/>於身起男想。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c09\">0159c09</span><p class=\"lg\">是中實無男，<caesura/>我說如陽焰，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c10\">0159c10</span><p class=\"lg\">知男相寂靜，<caesura/>是名男三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c11\">0159c11</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為童男相三昧？即說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c12\">0159c12</span>頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c13\">0159c13</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「如樹無根枝，<caesura/>花則不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c14\">0159c14</span><p class=\"lg\">以花無有故，<caesura/>其果亦不生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c15\">0159c15</span><p class=\"lg\">由無彼女人，<caesura/>童男亦非有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c16\">0159c16</span><p class=\"lg\">隨於分別者，<caesura/>假說如是名。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c17\">0159c17</span><p class=\"lg\">了知彼女人，<caesura/>及童男非有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c18\">0159c18</span><p class=\"lg\">能如是觀察，<caesura/>是童男三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c19\">0159c19</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為童女相三昧？即說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c20\">0159c20</span>頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c21\">0159c21</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「如斷多羅樹，<caesura/>畢竟不復生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c22\">0159c22</span><p class=\"lg\">何有智慧人，<caesura/>於中求果實？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c23\">0159c23</span><p class=\"lg\">若有能了知，<caesura/>諸法無生者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c24\">0159c24</span><p class=\"lg\">不應起分別，<caesura/>童女為能生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c25\">0159c25</span><p class=\"lg\">又如焦穀種，<caesura/>其<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0159002\">牙＝芽【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0159002\">牙【大】，芽【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0159002\"><p class=\"lg\">牙</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">芽</rdg></app>本不生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c26\">0159c26</span><p class=\"lg\">女人亦復然，<caesura/>是童女三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c27\">0159c27</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為天相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c28\">0159c28</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0159c29\">0159c29</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「因清淨信心，<caesura/>及以眾善業，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a01\">0160a01</span><p class=\"lg\">受諸天勝報，<caesura/>端正殊妙身。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a02\">0160a02</span><p class=\"lg\">珍寶諸宮殿，<caesura/>非由造作成，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a03\">0160a03</span><p class=\"lg\">曼陀羅妙花，<caesura/>亦無種植者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a04\">0160a04</span><p class=\"lg\">如是不思議，<caesura/>皆因業力起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a05\">0160a05</span><p class=\"lg\">能現種種相，<caesura/>猶<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0160001\">若＝如【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0160001\">若【大】，如【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0160001\"><p class=\"lg\">若</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">如</rdg></app>淨琉璃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a06\">0160a06</span><p class=\"lg\">如是殊妙身，<caesura/>及諸宮殿等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a07\">0160a07</span><p class=\"lg\">皆從虛妄生，<caesura/>是名天三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a08\">0160a08</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為龍相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a09\">0160a09</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a10\">0160a10</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「受此諸龍身，<caesura/>由不修於忍，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a11\">0160a11</span><p class=\"lg\">興澍大雲雨，<caesura/>遍滿閻浮提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a12\">0160a12</span><p class=\"lg\">不從前後際，<caesura/>亦不在中間，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a13\">0160a13</span><p class=\"lg\">而能生此水，<caesura/>復歸於大海。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a14\">0160a14</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸龍等，<caesura/>積習性差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a15\">0160a15</span><p class=\"lg\">起於種種業，<caesura/>業亦無有生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a16\">0160a16</span><p class=\"lg\">一切非真實，<caesura/>愚者謂為有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a17\">0160a17</span><p class=\"lg\">能如是了知，<caesura/>是名龍三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a18\">0160a18</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為夜叉相三昧？即說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a19\">0160a19</span>頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a20\">0160a20</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「是大夜叉身，<caesura/>從於自心起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a21\">0160a21</span><p class=\"lg\">是中無有實，<caesura/>妄生於恐怖，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a22\">0160a22</span><p class=\"lg\">亦無有怖心，<caesura/>而生於怖畏。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a23\">0160a23</span><p class=\"lg\">觀法非實故，<caesura/>無相無所得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a24\">0160a24</span><p class=\"lg\">空無寂靜處，<caesura/>現此夜叉相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a25\">0160a25</span><p class=\"lg\">如是知虛妄，<caesura/>是夜叉三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a26\">0160a26</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為乾闥婆相三昧？即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a27\">0160a27</span>說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a28\">0160a28</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「彼實無所趣，<caesura/>名言假施設，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160a29\">0160a29</span><p class=\"lg\">了知趣非趣，<caesura/>乾闥婆三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b01\">0160b01</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為阿修羅相三昧？即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b02\">0160b02</span>說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b03\">0160b03</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「修羅相所印，<caesura/>其相本無生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b04\">0160b04</span><p class=\"lg\">無生故無滅，<caesura/>阿修羅三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b05\">0160b05</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為迦樓羅相三昧？即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b06\">0160b06</span>說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b07\">0160b07</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「無身以為身，<caesura/>名字假施設，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b08\">0160b08</span><p class=\"lg\">名相無所有，<caesura/>迦樓羅三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b09\">0160b09</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為緊那羅相三昧？即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b10\">0160b10</span>說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b11\">0160b11</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「法無作而作，<caesura/>說為緊那羅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b12\">0160b12</span><p class=\"lg\">了知此不生，<caesura/>緊那羅三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b13\">0160b13</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為摩睺羅伽相三昧？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b14\">0160b14</span>即說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b15\">0160b15</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「彼由於名字，<caesura/>隨世而安立，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b16\">0160b16</span><p class=\"lg\">是中無有法，<caesura/>而妄起分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b17\">0160b17</span><p class=\"lg\">了知此分別，<caesura/>自性無所有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b18\">0160b18</span><p class=\"lg\">彼相寂靜故，<caesura/>摩睺羅三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b19\">0160b19</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為地獄相三昧？即說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b20\">0160b20</span>頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b21\">0160b21</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「地獄空無<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0160002\">相＝垢【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0160002\">相【大】，垢【宮】</span><app n=\"0160002\"><p class=\"lg\">相</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">垢</rdg></app>，<caesura/>其性極清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b22\">0160b22</span><p class=\"lg\">是中無作者，<caesura/>從自分別生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b23\">0160b23</span><p class=\"lg\">我坐道場時，<caesura/>了此無生相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b24\">0160b24</span><p class=\"lg\">無相無生故，<caesura/>其性如虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b25\">0160b25</span><p class=\"lg\">此相皆寂靜，<caesura/>是地獄三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b26\">0160b26</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為畜生相三昧？即說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b27\">0160b27</span>頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b28\">0160b28</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「如雲現眾色，<caesura/>是中無有實，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160b29\">0160b29</span><p class=\"lg\">能令無智人，<caesura/>於此生迷惑，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c01\">0160c01</span><p class=\"lg\">於彼畜生趣，<caesura/>而受種種身。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c02\">0160c02</span><p class=\"lg\">猶如虛空雲，<caesura/>現於諸色像，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c03\">0160c03</span><p class=\"lg\">了知業如幻，<caesura/>不生迷惑心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c04\">0160c04</span><p class=\"lg\">彼相本寂靜，<caesura/>是畜生三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c05\">0160c05</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為閻魔羅界三昧？即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c06\">0160c06</span>說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c07\">0160c07</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「造作純黑業，<caesura/>及以雜業者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c08\">0160c08</span><p class=\"lg\">流轉閻羅界，<caesura/>受於種種苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c09\">0160c09</span><p class=\"lg\">實無閻羅界，<caesura/>亦無流轉者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c10\">0160c10</span><p class=\"lg\">自性本無生，<caesura/>諸苦猶如夢，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c11\">0160c11</span><p class=\"lg\">若能如是觀，<caesura/>閻羅界三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c12\">0160c12</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為貪相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c13\">0160c13</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c14\">0160c14</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「貪從分別生，<caesura/>分別亦非有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c15\">0160c15</span><p class=\"lg\">無生亦無相，<caesura/>住處不可得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c16\">0160c16</span><p class=\"lg\">貪性如虛空，<caesura/>亦無有建立，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c17\">0160c17</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫妄分別，<caesura/>由斯貪染生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c18\">0160c18</span><p class=\"lg\">法性本無染，<caesura/>清淨如虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c19\">0160c19</span><p class=\"lg\">十方遍推求，<caesura/>其性不可得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c20\">0160c20</span><p class=\"lg\">不了性空故，<caesura/>見貪生怖畏，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c21\">0160c21</span><p class=\"lg\">無畏生畏想，<caesura/>於何得安樂？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c22\">0160c22</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如愚癡人，<caesura/>怖畏於虛空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c23\">0160c23</span><p class=\"lg\">驚懼而馳走，<caesura/>避空不欲見。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c24\">0160c24</span><p class=\"lg\">虛空遍一切，<caesura/>於何而得離？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c25\">0160c25</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫迷惑故，<caesura/>顛倒分別生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c26\">0160c26</span><p class=\"lg\">貪本無自性，<caesura/>妄生厭離心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c27\">0160c27</span><p class=\"lg\">如人欲避空，<caesura/>終無能脫者；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c28\">0160c28</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法性自離，<caesura/>猶如於涅槃。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0160c29\">0160c29</span><p class=\"lg\">三世一切佛，<caesura/>了知貪性空，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a01\">0161a01</span><p class=\"lg\">住此境界中，<caesura/>未曾有捨離；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a02\">0161a02</span><p class=\"lg\">於貪怖畏者，<caesura/>思惟求解脫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a03\">0161a03</span><p class=\"lg\">如是貪自性，<caesura/>究竟常清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a04\">0161a04</span><p class=\"lg\">我證菩提時，<caesura/>了達皆平等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a05\">0161a05</span><p class=\"lg\">若執貪為有，<caesura/>於彼當捨離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a06\">0161a06</span><p class=\"lg\">由妄分別故，<caesura/>而言捨離貪。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a07\">0161a07</span><p class=\"lg\">此唯分別心，<caesura/>實無有捨離，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a08\">0161a08</span><p class=\"lg\">其性不可得，<caesura/>亦無有滅壞，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a09\">0161a09</span><p class=\"lg\">平等實際中，<caesura/>無解脫分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a10\">0161a10</span><p class=\"lg\">若於貪解脫，<caesura/>於空亦解脫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a11\">0161a11</span><p class=\"lg\">虛空及與貪，<caesura/>無盡無差別；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a12\">0161a12</span><p class=\"lg\">若見差別者，<caesura/>我說令捨離。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a13\">0161a13</span><p class=\"lg\">貪實無有生，<caesura/>妄起生分別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a14\">0161a14</span><p class=\"lg\">彼貪本性空，<caesura/>但有假名字，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a15\">0161a15</span><p class=\"lg\">不應以此名，<caesura/>而生於執著。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a16\">0161a16</span><p class=\"lg\">了貪無染故，<caesura/>是則畢竟空，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a17\">0161a17</span><p class=\"lg\">不由滅壞貪，<caesura/>而得於解脫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a18\">0161a18</span><p class=\"lg\">貪法與佛法，<caesura/>平等即涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a19\">0161a19</span><p class=\"lg\">智者應當知，<caesura/>了貪寂靜已，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a20\">0161a20</span><p class=\"lg\">入於寂靜界，<caesura/>是名貪三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a21\">0161a21</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為瞋相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a22\">0161a22</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a23\">0161a23</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「以虛妄因緣，<caesura/>而起於瞋恚，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a24\">0161a24</span><p class=\"lg\">無我執為我，<caesura/>及由麁惡聲，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a25\">0161a25</span><p class=\"lg\">起猛利瞋心，<caesura/>猶如於惡毒，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a26\">0161a26</span><p class=\"lg\">音聲及瞋恚，<caesura/>究竟無所有。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a27\">0161a27</span><p class=\"lg\">如鑽木出火，<caesura/>要假眾緣力，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a28\">0161a28</span><p class=\"lg\">若緣不和合，<caesura/>火終不得生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161a29\">0161a29</span><p class=\"lg\">是不悅意聲，<caesura/>畢竟無所有，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b01\">0161b01</span><p class=\"lg\">知聲性空故，<caesura/>瞋亦不復生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b02\">0161b02</span><p class=\"lg\">瞋不在於聲，<caesura/>亦不身中住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b03\">0161b03</span><p class=\"lg\">因緣和合起，<caesura/>離緣終不生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b04\">0161b04</span><p class=\"lg\">如因乳等緣，<caesura/>和合生酥酪，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b05\">0161b05</span><p class=\"lg\">瞋自性無起，<caesura/>因於麁惡聲。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b06\">0161b06</span><p class=\"lg\">愚者不能了，<caesura/>熱惱自燒然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b07\">0161b07</span><p class=\"lg\">應當如是知，<caesura/>究竟無所有。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b08\">0161b08</span><p class=\"lg\">瞋性本寂靜，<caesura/>但有於假名，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b09\">0161b09</span><p class=\"lg\">瞋恚即實際，<caesura/>以依真如起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b10\">0161b10</span><p class=\"lg\">了知如法界，<caesura/>是名瞋三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b11\">0161b11</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為癡相三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b12\">0161b12</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b13\">0161b13</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「無明體性空，<caesura/>本自無生起，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b14\">0161b14</span><p class=\"lg\">是中無少法，<caesura/>而可說為癡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b15\">0161b15</span><p class=\"lg\">凡夫於無癡，<caesura/>而妄生癡想，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b16\">0161b16</span><p class=\"lg\">於無著生著，<caesura/>猶若結虛空。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b17\">0161b17</span><p class=\"lg\">奇哉愚癡人，<caesura/>不應作而作，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b18\">0161b18</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法皆非有，<caesura/>雜染分別生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b19\">0161b19</span><p class=\"lg\">如欲取虛空，<caesura/>安置於一處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b20\">0161b20</span><p class=\"lg\">設經千萬劫，<caesura/>終無有積聚。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b21\">0161b21</span><p class=\"lg\">愚夫從本來，<caesura/>經不思議劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b22\">0161b22</span><p class=\"lg\">所起於癡結，<caesura/>而無少分增。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b23\">0161b23</span><p class=\"lg\">如彼取虛空，<caesura/>終無有增減，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b24\">0161b24</span><p class=\"lg\">多劫集於癡，<caesura/>增減亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b25\">0161b25</span><p class=\"lg\">又如於槖籥，<caesura/>受風無際限，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b26\">0161b26</span><p class=\"lg\">愚癡著欲樂，<caesura/>無有厭足時。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b27\">0161b27</span><p class=\"lg\">是癡無所有，<caesura/>無根無住處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b28\">0161b28</span><p class=\"lg\">以根非有故，<caesura/>亦無癡可盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161b29\">0161b29</span><p class=\"lg\">以癡無盡故，<caesura/>邊際不可得，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c01\">0161c01</span><p class=\"lg\">是故諸眾生，<caesura/>我不能令盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c02\">0161c02</span><p class=\"lg\">設我一日中，<caesura/>能度三千界，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c03\">0161c03</span><p class=\"lg\">所有諸眾生，<caesura/>皆令入涅槃，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c04\">0161c04</span><p class=\"lg\">復經不思議，<caesura/>無量千萬劫，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c05\">0161c05</span><p class=\"lg\">日日如是化，<caesura/>眾生界不盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c06\">0161c06</span><p class=\"lg\">癡界眾生界，<caesura/>是二俱無相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c07\">0161c07</span><p class=\"lg\">彼皆如幻化，<caesura/>故不能令盡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c08\">0161c08</span><p class=\"lg\">癡性與佛性，<caesura/>平等無差別，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c09\">0161c09</span><p class=\"lg\">若分別於佛，<caesura/>彼則住愚癡。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c10\">0161c10</span><p class=\"lg\">癡及一切智，<caesura/>性皆不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c11\">0161c11</span><p class=\"lg\">然彼諸眾生，<caesura/>皆與癡平等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c12\">0161c12</span><p class=\"lg\">眾生不思議，<caesura/>癡亦不思議，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c13\">0161c13</span><p class=\"lg\">以不思議故，<caesura/>不應<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0161001\">取＝起【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0161001\">取【大】，起【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0161001\"><p class=\"lg\">取</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">起</rdg></app>分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c14\">0161c14</span><p class=\"lg\">如是思惟心，<caesura/>思量不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c15\">0161c15</span><p class=\"lg\">癡亦不可量，<caesura/>以無邊際故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c16\">0161c16</span><p class=\"lg\">既無有邊際，<caesura/>從何而得生，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c17\">0161c17</span><p class=\"lg\">自性無生故，<caesura/>相亦不可得。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c18\">0161c18</span><p class=\"lg\">了癡無有相，<caesura/>觀佛亦復然，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c19\">0161c19</span><p class=\"lg\">應當如是知，<caesura/>一切法無二。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c20\">0161c20</span><p class=\"lg\">癡性本寂靜，<caesura/>但有於假名，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c21\">0161c21</span><p class=\"lg\">我證菩提時，<caesura/>亦了癡平等，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c22\">0161c22</span><p class=\"lg\">能作如是觀，<caesura/>是名癡三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c23\">0161c23</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為不善三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c24\">0161c24</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c25\">0161c25</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「知彼貪瞋癡，<caesura/>種種諸煩惱，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c26\">0161c26</span><p class=\"lg\">所有諸行相，<caesura/>虛妄無真實，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c27\">0161c27</span><p class=\"lg\">能如是觀察，<caesura/>是不善三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c28\">0161c28</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名為善法三昧？即說頌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0161c29\">0161c29</span>曰：</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a01\">0162a01</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「汝等應當知，<caesura/>諸善意樂者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a02\">0162a02</span><p class=\"lg\">心行各差別，<caesura/>皆同於一行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a03\">0162a03</span><p class=\"lg\">以一出離相，<caesura/>了知於一切，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a04\">0162a04</span><p class=\"lg\">皆悉寂靜故，<caesura/>是名善三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a05\">0162a05</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名有為三昧？即說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a06\">0162a06</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「汝等應當知，<caesura/>一切有為法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a07\">0162a07</span><p class=\"lg\">非是所造作，<caesura/>亦無可稱量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a08\">0162a08</span><p class=\"lg\">我了知諸行，<caesura/>性無有積集，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a09\">0162a09</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆寂靜，<caesura/>名有為三昧。</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a10\">0162a10</span><p>「復次文殊師利！云何名無為三昧？即說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a11\">0162a11</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「無為性寂靜，<caesura/>於中無所著，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a12\">0162a12</span><p class=\"lg\">亦復無出離，<caesura/>但有假名字。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a13\">0162a13</span><p class=\"lg\">為執著眾生，<caesura/>而說彼名字，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a14\">0162a14</span><p class=\"lg\">能如是了知，<caesura/>名無為三昧。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a15\">0162a15</span><p>爾時世尊說如是等不可思議微妙偈時，九\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a16\">0162a16</span>萬二千菩薩得無生法忍，三萬六千比丘而\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a17\">0162a17</span>於諸漏心得解脫；七十二萬億那由他諸天\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a18\">0162a18</span>及六千比丘尼、一百八十萬優婆塞、二千二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a19\">0162a19</span>百優婆夷等，皆發阿耨多羅三藐三菩提心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a20\">0162a20</span><p>爾時文殊師利菩薩復白佛言：「唯願世尊！為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a21\">0162a21</span>諸菩薩演說種種三昧名字，令其聞者諸根\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a22\">0162a22</span>通利，而於諸法得智慧明，不為一切邪見眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a23\">0162a23</span>生之所摧伏，亦令證得四無礙辯，於一文字\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a24\">0162a24</span>而能了知種種文字，於諸文字了一文字。復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a25\">0162a25</span>以無邊辯才，為諸眾生善說法要，亦令證得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a26\">0162a26</span>甚深法忍，於一剎那了一切行。是一切行，各\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a27\">0162a27</span>各復有無邊行相皆能了知。」</p><p>佛言：「文殊師利！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a28\">0162a28</span>有三昧名無邊離垢，若菩薩得此三昧，能現\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162a29\">0162a29</span>一切諸清淨色。復有三昧名可畏面，得此三\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b01\">0162b01</span>昧有大威光映蔽日月。復有三昧名出焰光，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b02\">0162b02</span>得此三昧能蔽一切釋梵威光。復有三昧名\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b03\">0162b03</span>為出離，得此三昧令諸眾生出離一切貪恚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b04\">0162b04</span>愚癡。復有三昧名無礙光，得此三昧則能照\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b05\">0162b05</span>曜一切佛剎。復有三昧名無忘失，得此三昧\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b06\">0162b06</span>能持諸佛所說教法，亦能為他敷演斯義。復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b07\">0162b07</span>有三昧名曰雷音，得此三昧善能顯示一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b08\">0162b08</span>言音上至梵世。復有三昧名為喜樂，得此三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b09\">0162b09</span>昧令諸眾生喜樂滿足。復有三昧名喜無厭，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b10\">0162b10</span>得此三昧其見聞者無有厭足。復有三昧名\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b11\">0162b11</span>專一境難思功德，得此三昧而能示現一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b12\">0162b12</span>神變。復有三昧名解一切眾生語言，得此三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b13\">0162b13</span>昧善能宣說一切語言，於一字中說一切字，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b14\">0162b14</span>了一切字同於一字。復有三昧名超一切陀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b15\">0162b15</span>羅尼王，得此三昧能善了知諸陀羅尼。復有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b16\">0162b16</span>三昧名為一切辯才莊嚴，得此三昧善能分\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b17\">0162b17</span>別一切文字種種言音。復有三昧名為積集\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b18\">0162b18</span>一切善法，得此三昧能令眾生悉聞佛聲法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b19\">0162b19</span>聲僧聲、聲聞聲緣覺聲、菩薩聲波羅蜜聲，如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b20\">0162b20</span>是菩薩住三昧時，令諸眾生聞聲不絕。」</p><p>爾時\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b21\">0162b21</span>文殊師利白佛言：「唯願世尊！加威護念，令我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b22\">0162b22</span>獲得無礙辯才，說此法門殊勝功德。」</p><p>佛言：「善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b23\">0162b23</span>哉！隨汝所願。」</p><p>文殊師利復白佛言：「若有菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b24\">0162b24</span>於此法門受持讀誦無疑惑者，當知是人於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b25\">0162b25</span>現身中，決定獲得四種辯才，所謂捷疾辯才、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b26\">0162b26</span>廣大辯才、甚深辯才、無盡辯才，於諸眾生心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b27\">0162b27</span>常護念，隨所修行欲毀壞者，皆能覺悟令無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b28\">0162b28</span>毀壞。」</p><p>爾時世尊讚文殊師利菩薩言：「善哉善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162b29\">0162b29</span>哉！汝於斯義能善分別，如布施者獲大財富，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c01\">0162c01</span>持禁戒者決定生天。若能受持此經典者，現\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c02\">0162c02</span>得辯才必無虛妄。如日光出能除諸暝，亦如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c03\">0162c03</span>菩薩坐菩提座成等正覺決定無疑，受持讀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c04\">0162c04</span>誦是經典者，現得辯才亦復如是。文殊師利！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c05\">0162c05</span>若復有人於現身中欲求辯才，當於此經心\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c06\">0162c06</span>生信樂，受持讀誦廣為人說，勿生疑惑。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c07\">0162c07</span><p>爾時無垢藏菩薩白佛言：「世尊！若諸菩薩，佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c08\">0162c08</span>涅槃後於此法門心無疑惑，受持讀誦為他\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c09\">0162c09</span>廣說，我當攝受加其辯才。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c10\">0162c10</span><p>爾時天魔波旬愁憂苦惱悲涕流淚來詣佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c11\">0162c11</span>所，而白佛言：「如來昔證無上菩提，我於爾時\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c12\">0162c12</span>已懷憂惱。復於今者說此法門，倍生大苦如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c13\">0162c13</span>中毒箭。若諸眾生聞是經典，決定當於阿耨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c14\">0162c14</span>多羅三藐三菩提無有退轉入般涅槃，令我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c15\">0162c15</span>境界皆悉空虛。如來、應、正等覺能令一切諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c16\">0162c16</span>苦眾生咸得安樂，願垂哀愍<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0162001\">與＝興【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0162001\">與【大】，興【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0162001\"><p class=\"lg\">與</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">興</rdg></app>大慈悲，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c17\">0162c17</span>於此經加威護念，令我安隱憂苦皆除。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c18\">0162c18</span><p>爾時世尊告波旬言：「勿懷憂惱。我於此法不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c19\">0162c19</span>作加護，諸眾生等亦不涅槃。」天魔波旬聞是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c20\">0162c20</span>語已，歡喜踊躍憂惱悉除，即於佛前忽然不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c21\">0162c21</span>現。</p><p>爾時文殊師利菩薩前白佛言：「如來今者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c22\">0162c22</span>有何密意，告波旬言我於此法不作加護？」</p><p>佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c23\">0162c23</span>言：「文殊師利！以無加護加護此法，是故為彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c24\">0162c24</span>說如是言。以一切法平等實際，皆歸真如同\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c25\">0162c25</span>於法界，離諸言說不二相故，無有加護。以我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c26\">0162c26</span>如是誠實之言無有虛妄，能令此經於閻浮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c27\">0162c27</span>提廣行流布。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c28\">0162c28</span><p>爾時世尊說是語已，告阿難言：「此經名為『普\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0162c29\">0162c29</span>入不思議法門』，若能受持如是經典，則為受\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a01\">0163a01</span>持八萬四千法門等無差別。何以故？我於此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a02\">0163a02</span>經善通達已，方能為彼諸眾生等演說八萬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a03\">0163a03</span>四千法門。是故阿難！汝於此法當善護持，讀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a04\">0163a04</span>誦流通無令忘失。」</p><p>佛說是經已，文殊師利菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a05\">0163a05</span>薩、無垢藏菩薩、尊者阿難，及諸世間天、人、阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a06\">0163a06</span>修羅、乾闥婆等，聞佛所說，皆大歡喜，信受奉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a07\">0163a07</span>行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0163a08\">0163a08</span><cb:juan n=\"029\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第二十九</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}